<body>
    <h1>Salesforce Hierarchy Management Runbook</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-m=
acro-information">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-informa=
tion-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"bfc1a449aa86">Admin runbook for changing Unit__c, Solution_G=
roup__c, Solution_Category__c, and Solution__c across the product, territor=
y, pricing, and reporting footprint in Fortra=E2=80=99s Salesforce environm=
ent.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"722f09ec4140" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-Co=
ntents">Contents</h2>
<ul local-id=3D"9de7c67f6b2d">
<li local-id=3D"fd7978b70a60">
<p local-id=3D"609eb9dd9f1e">Overview</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2d4baf68c137">
<p local-id=3D"1508e5280f15">Unit__c</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"107bc1a8f0f3">
<p local-id=3D"ac1e3c4e1b57">Solution_Group__c</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"dc4526db81dd">
<p local-id=3D"dbd7b2805fc0">Solution_Category__c</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e97bd01a6238">
<p local-id=3D"c798b9746b65">Solution__c</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b66bfb788c15">
<p local-id=3D"1ed8e236ad6a">Automation Test Matrix</p></li>
</ul>
<h2 local-id=3D"3a2941a7201c" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-Ov=
erview">Overview</h2>
<p local-id=3D"5dd445d03ce2">The hierarchy does not live in a single model.=
 Some fields are shared picklists, some are dependent picklists, and some a=
re plain text on product or metadata records. Because of that, every hierar=
chy change needs to be handled at the field level, not as a generic metadat=
a task.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"1234f52942c6">
<li local-id=3D"6c6d6147f45a">
<p local-id=3D"878e561bd00a">Unit__c =3D shared picklist</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b98089954d81">
<p local-id=3D"7d1b8f585c67">Solution_Group__c =3D mixed picklist + text</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"3bfcf784feb0">
<p local-id=3D"8db9a51bba8b">Solution_Category__c =3D mixed picklist + text=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f52336624016">
<p local-id=3D"163127161570">Solution__c =3D text</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"75fb7db137e6">For an Add, existing records only need updates=
 if some current records should begin using the new value. For a Rename or =
Remove, the dependency work still has to be done: mappings, hardcoded refer=
ences, text-field records, related metadata, and regression testing.</p>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-not=
e">
<span class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-warning confluence-info=
rmation-macro-icon"></span>
<div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
<p local-id=3D"9d0d5f69bf7e">Primary risk: Product2 stores three hierarchy =
levels as text, so metadata changes do not cascade automatically.</p>
</div>
</div>
<h2 local-id=3D"361fdb5aee1a" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-Un=
it__c">Unit__c</h2>
<p local-id=3D"f0af3621631c">Unit__c is the most controlled hierarchy field=
. It uses the shared value set Unit and also acts as the controlling field =
for Solution_Group__c on three objects.</p>
<h3 local-id=3D"8efc7d96cef5" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-Fi=
eldInventory">Field Inventory</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"d0=
ce25f5d6e4" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"c49829ab2d04">
<th data-local-id=3D"33618feb7c72" class=3D"confluenceTh">
