<h3 local-id=3D"d9b537661e8d" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-Cu=
rrentDependentMappingsFromUnit__cToSolution_Group__c">Current Dependent Map=
pings From Unit__c To Solution_Group__c</h3>
<p local-id=3D"50b95b061e75">Mappings must be configured on Marketing_Produ=
ct__c, Sales_Territory__c, and AccountTeamMember as controlling (Unit__c) t=
o dependent (Solution_Group__c) value sets.</p>
<ul local-id=3D"481a89c968c7">
<li local-id=3D"dd1046da6e65">
<p local-id=3D"6bf9a0597384">Marketing_Product__c: Defensive Security, Offe=
nsive Security, Managed File Transfer, Power, RPA+</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f0839b2cd360">
<p local-id=3D"fdfc733d250e">Sales_Territory__c: Defensive Security, Offens=
ive Security, Managed File Transfer, Power, RPA+</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aced8b22ff7f">
<p local-id=3D"2fd5e227b795">AccountTeamMember: Defensive Security, Offensi=
ve Security, Managed File Transfer, Power, RPA+</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"81fa17f9edff" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-Ha=
rdcodedReferencesThatDependOnUnit__c">Hardcoded References That Depend On U=
nit__c</h3>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"de=
be80b6c55b" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"ea700f8a03e5">
<th data-local-id=3D"63352a24aa01" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b2655d0173ff"><strong>Component</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"0c48e8c4bb72" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"b24e179ebc11"><strong>Exact Dependency</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"31f134ef26ae">
<td data-local-id=3D"307f0543e1cb" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"37f6384a117a">Inquiry_Conversion_Screen_Flow</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"3ad6363401d0" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"0fb03db58f24">Screen visibility rule Get_triggering_Inquiry.=
Unit__c =3D Cyber</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"9edab95be952">
<td data-local-id=3D"6640085c83a6" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"5d2a1569be3f">Inquiry_Conversion_Screen_Flow</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"dcc9fbe42c0e" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4763eb686ec8">Screen visibility rule Get_triggering_Inquiry.=
Unit__c =3D Tech</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"b7ccfb90c3a5">
<td data-local-id=3D"13190c9a83ea" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"1775883f7650">Screen_Flow_Partner_Portal_Deal_Registration_F=
orm</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"939436c302b1" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"eac4ac3b1bc7">Decision branch Unit Selection is Cyber</p></t=
d>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4200efa74e54">
<td data-local-id=3D"e56d506d163c" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"9380955277dd">Screen_Flow_Partner_Portal_Deal_Registration_F=
orm</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7b084ea92948" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"3b47c370dc47">Lookup Get_Cyber_Marketing_Products filters Un=
it__c =3D Cyber</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"cedbcfde5133">
<td data-local-id=3D"66c8dd1f2446" class=3D"confluenceTd">
