<h3 local-id=3D"4ae44edd185c" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-Au=
tomationAndUIThatUsesUnit__cDynamically">Automation And UI That Uses Unit__=
c Dynamically</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"fa9bca5435b3">
<li local-id=3D"62a255d99a41">
<p local-id=3D"638cb48c28fd">TerritoryFlowHelper</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0e197874750b">
<p local-id=3D"0c681b93ad14">Sales_Inquiry_Territory_Assignment</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"267abf717f7c">
<p local-id=3D"455125a8b7cd">Sales_Territories_Before_Insert_Update</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"1d3b2be2f4eb">
<p local-id=3D"5e3accbbb601">Marketing_Product_Record_Page</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"3057f86dfc8b" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-Ch=
angeProcedures">Change Procedures</h3>
<h4 local-id=3D"61d1e407163c" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-If=
AddingANewUnit__c">If Adding A New Unit__c</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"23d8fb0bba7f">
<li local-id=3D"77d899d42e79">
<p local-id=3D"77915b743199">Add the new value to shared value set Unit.</p=
></li>
<li local-id=3D"ab622515dfc0">
<p local-id=3D"668b7402a9f8">Add new Unit__c -&gt; Solution_Group__c mappin=
gs on Marketing_Product__c, Sales_Territory__c, and AccountTeamMember.</p><=
/li>
<li local-id=3D"b0f1ed63ec81">
<p local-id=3D"50997c927d50">Update any existing records that should use th=
e new unit.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"e5a53cc80fec">
<p local-id=3D"40da9f4fd626">Review and update the hardcoded Flow logic if =
the new unit must be supported in Inquiry_Conversion_Screen_Flow and Screen=
_Flow_Partner_Portal_Deal_Registration_Form.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"72997b2412ec">
<p local-id=3D"ea6e2af76e0f">Run the test steps in the Automation Test Matr=
ix for the unit-dependent automations and UI paths.</p></li>
</ol>
<h4 local-id=3D"5abeb06f4257" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-If=
RenamingUnit__c">If Renaming Unit__c</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"37f6f81df7f6">
<li local-id=3D"b1ea66cba9f2">
<p local-id=3D"19b846abd84b">Rename the value in shared value set Unit.</p>=
</li>
<li local-id=3D"022a33571b6d">
<p local-id=3D"0121cc03b9b7">Replace the old controlling value in every Uni=
t__c -&gt; Solution_Group__c mapping listed above.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"cba47a2e72b7">
<p local-id=3D"21bf80f8d6ab">Update existing records holding the old unit o=
n Product2, Marketing_Product__c, Sales_Territory__c, AccountTeamMember, an=
d Lead.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8040e469fb6a">
<p local-id=3D"9a99a31992fc">Update the hardcoded references in Inquiry_Con=
version_Screen_Flow and Screen_Flow_Partner_Portal_Deal_Registration_Form.<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1475594275a4">
<p local-id=3D"09a89ddbebc4">Retest all unit-dependent automations and UI p=
aths.</p></li>
</ol>
<h4 local-id=3D"cf5b7684abd3" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-If=
RemovingUnit__c">If Removing Unit__c</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"efcb2dfb6657">
<li local-id=3D"6c19a3a027bb">
<p local-id=3D"ddf48abf26c9">Reassign or clear all records using that unit.=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b57d3c3bae45">
<p local-id=3D"b2fcdea83f9b">Remove all Unit__c -&gt; Solution_Group__c map=
pings that use that unit.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6fac467bfe93">
<p local-id=3D"a1d300d69e58">Remove or replace any hardcoded Flow reference=
s to that unit.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"679b24d1414f">
<p local-id=3D"ee494a8bddee">Remove the value from shared value set Unit.</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"457154649c10">
<p local-id=3D"efdb7da71ff9">Retest all unit-dependent automations and UI p=
aths.</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"565808081c1f" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-So=
lution_Group__c">Solution_Group__c</h2>
<p local-id=3D"4cad743d87fd">Solution_Group__c is a mixed model. It is a de=
pendent picklist on three objects, but it is plain text on Product2 and Par=
tner_Discount_Matrix__c. That means a rename or removal requires both metad=
ata work and data remediation.</p>
