<h3 local-id=3D"4cee5fbc4b0f" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-Au=
tomationAndUIThatUsesSolution_Group__cDynamically">Automation And UI That U=
ses Solution_Group__c Dynamically</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"3e9afa00fd14">
<li local-id=3D"3e7887d0da0c">
<p local-id=3D"7e08a3dacdce">TerritoryFlowHelper</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"3c2923316c30">
<p local-id=3D"8828d191fe3f">Sales_Territories_Before_Insert_Update</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"03fc9adbf2ad">
<p local-id=3D"645fa55184ee">Marketing_Product_Record_Page</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"02ce5e2b0ca5" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-Ch=
angeProcedures.1">Change Procedures</h3>
<h4 local-id=3D"cf34d3b60e5b" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-If=
AddingANewSolution_Group__c">If Adding A New Solution_Group__c</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"70c9f17d8703">
<li local-id=3D"979d5f4f6797">
<p local-id=3D"d0d854652df3">Add the new value to Marketing_Product__c.Solu=
tion_Group__c and to shared value set Solution_Group.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d3f5f669f829">
<p local-id=3D"b57c5e35e685">Add the new Unit__c -&gt; Solution_Group__c ma=
ppings on Marketing_Product__c, Sales_Territory__c, and AccountTeamMember.<=
/p></li>
<li local-id=3D"91c514892e28">
<p local-id=3D"d9c91e42acc8">Update any existing records that should use th=
e new group on Product2, Marketing_Product__c, Sales_Territory__c, AccountT=
eamMember, and Partner_Discount_Matrix__c.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1a6acbf39cf0">
<p local-id=3D"29aa0483855e">Update hardcoded logic if the new group must b=
e supported in displayAndFilterKnowledge.js, Partner_Product_Compliance_Ale=
rt, or PowerOrderSplittingService.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"44e97dd94d5a">
<p local-id=3D"444455f7d912">Run the solution-group tests in the Automation=
 Test Matrix.</p></li>
</ol>
<h4 local-id=3D"76fec6da38b3" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-If=
RenamingSolution_Group__c">If Renaming Solution_Group__c</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"ca6c813fb121">
<li local-id=3D"958835c83c48">
<p local-id=3D"59d02edfb218">Rename the value in Marketing_Product__c.Solut=
ion_Group__c and in shared value set Solution_Group.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"7a86b0dd850d">
<p local-id=3D"a8caeb24aabd">Replace the old value in every Unit__c -&gt; S=
olution_Group__c mapping listed above.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9ecebf3f0ca6">
<p local-id=3D"704ff1d09b53">Update all existing text data holding the old =
group on Product2.Solution_Group__c and Partner_Discount_Matrix__c.Solution=
_Group__c.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0a357ad0b3ec">
<p local-id=3D"abd63fadb21c">Update hardcoded logic in displayAndFilterKnow=
ledge.js, Partner_Product_Compliance_Alert, and PowerOrderSplittingService =
if the renamed group is Power.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f05d227c8303">
<p local-id=3D"c1fac22df430">Update existing technical products if they sho=
uld reflect the rename.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"911fee7ac397">
<p local-id=3D"dcd9e72a970f">Retest all solution-group-dependent automation=
s and UI paths.</p></li>
</ol>
<h4 local-id=3D"0ace29594195" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-If=
RemovingSolution_Group__c">If Removing Solution_Group__c</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"a3e68e5d1ce9">
<li local-id=3D"9a0d0c49db33">
<p local-id=3D"ef97d70bcc27">Reassign or clear all records using that group=
.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"1dcbb2274c09">
<p local-id=3D"513761387efe">Remove the Unit__c -&gt; Solution_Group__c map=
pings listed above for that group.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a5d3dd3d7522">
<p local-id=3D"9699c96684f5">Remove or replace hardcoded references in disp=
layAndFilterKnowledge.js, Partner_Product_Compliance_Alert, and PowerOrderS=
plittingService.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"aae94daa4236">
<p local-id=3D"fb1a4aba71e3">Remove the value from Marketing_Product__c.Sol=
ution_Group__c and from shared value set Solution_Group.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f32efdb6288b">
<p local-id=3D"335c58f03ea6">Retest all solution-group-dependent automation=
s and UI paths.</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"a14a01208a46" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-So=
lution_Category__c">Solution_Category__c</h2>
<p local-id=3D"cad8b1626c8a">Solution_Category__c is the most operationally=
 sensitive hierarchy field because it feeds pricing maintenance, COLA logic=
, territory assignment, dashboards, and campaign classification. It is a de=
pendent picklist on three objects, a shared picklist on Campaign, and text =
elsewhere.</p>
