<div class=3D"panel" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;border-color: #998D=
D9;border-width: 1px;">
<div class=3D"panelContent" style=3D"background-color: #EAE6FF;">
<p local-id=3D"7eb4305d6a8a">Important: AccountTeamMember currently has the=
 Power and RPA+ category sets reversed compared with Marketing_Product__c a=
nd Sales_Territory__c. Preserve that behavior unless the intent is to corre=
ct it as a separate change.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p local-id=3D"fb39c6b1f0ed">Allowed categories by Solution_Group__c:</p>
<ul local-id=3D"5b994860732c">
<li local-id=3D"bc072aba8d46">
<p local-id=3D"cf7ea69202e5">Marketing_Product__c</p>
<ul local-id=3D"2990abb690fb">
<li local-id=3D"3040b0fbc71f">
<p local-id=3D"361075e35920">Defensive Security: Vulnerability Management, =
File Integrity Monitoring, Email Security, Brand Protection, Human Risk Man=
agement, Data Protection, Cloud Data Protection, Fortra Platform</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"357bd906ac74">
<p local-id=3D"836427b97fce">Managed File Transfer: GoAnywhere, Globalscape=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"358e02d80515">
<p local-id=3D"5a42b61ff0ab">Power: Power (multiple sub-categories as confi=
gured)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6e3ff28b11a8">
<p local-id=3D"834c78419c8e">RPA+: Business Intelligence, Doc Management, S=
ystems Management, Cybersecurity, IPP, Robotic Process Automation</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"6b494a2ca3db">
<p local-id=3D"f548f388de8e">Sales_Territory__c</p>
<ul local-id=3D"21260f712e95">
<li local-id=3D"619a0a2d0b3b">
<p local-id=3D"a9ee0bdd3d11">Defensive Security: Vulnerability Management, =
File Integrity Monitoring, Email Security, Brand Protection, Human Risk Man=
agement, Data Protection, Cloud Data Protection, Fortra Platform</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"18ba5103f0c3">
<p local-id=3D"b3a831ad0549">Managed File Transfer: GoAnywhere, Globalscape=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4041e00bb37d">
<p local-id=3D"1cbebae196ed">Power: Power (multiple sub-categories as confi=
gured)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"272d1bbbe438">
<p local-id=3D"d73be6fd0c7b">RPA+: Business Intelligence, Doc Management, S=
ystems Management, Cybersecurity, IPP, Robotic Process Automation, Core IGA=
, Network Monitoring, Powertech Identity &amp; Access Manager (BoKS), Capac=
ity Management</p></li>
</ul></li>
<li local-id=3D"0fab2ca809d0">
<p local-id=3D"ee9bca30654e">AccountTeamMember</p>
<ul local-id=3D"d2d0dfb79a14">
<li local-id=3D"d4d31d31b62b">
<p local-id=3D"10050485a98d">Defensive Security: Vulnerability Management, =
File Integrity Monitoring, Email Security, Brand Protection, Human Risk Man=
agement, Data Protection, Cloud Data Protection, Fortra Platform</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"de212e39a64a">
<p local-id=3D"c5a82ad31b9b">Managed File Transfer: GoAnywhere, Globalscape=
</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d8569f455dbe">
<p local-id=3D"b8bfd3de8074">Power: Power (multiple sub-categories as confi=
gured)</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0b858ae668fd">
<p local-id=3D"d97d83a831ec">RPA+: Robotic Process Automation, Core IGA, Ne=
twork Monitoring, Powertech Identity &amp; Access Manager (BoKS), Capacity =
Management, Business Intelligence, Doc Management, Systems Management, Cybe=
rsecurity, IPP</p></li>
</ul></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"48b8f49ce593" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-Ha=
rdcodedReferencesThatDependOnSolution_Category__c">Hardcoded References Tha=
t Depend On Solution_Category__c</h3>
