</table>
</div>
<h3 local-id=3D"04a0f389f5b0" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-Au=
tomationAndUIThatUsesSolution_Category__cDynamically">Automation And UI Tha=
t Uses Solution_Category__c Dynamically</h3>
<ul local-id=3D"740ec338cb26">
<li local-id=3D"a90c9ee77ad2">
<p local-id=3D"28d777179212">TerritoryFlowHelper</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"4f1418c429a2">
<p local-id=3D"ed586b41f222">Sales_Territories_Before_Insert_Update</p></li=
>
<li local-id=3D"d45a04578def">
<p local-id=3D"450f2f699dde">Sales_Inquiry_Territory_Assignment</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"17ff09409296">
<p local-id=3D"a67508eef69c">Fortra_BulkPriceUpdateInvocable</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"575212f91cac">
<p local-id=3D"39911465d638">Fortra_BulkPriceUpdateBatch</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"8e499cdfc317">
<p local-id=3D"870adb67bb39">Marketing_Product_Record_Page</p></li>
</ul>
<h3 local-id=3D"0d4870cf68d2" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-Ch=
angeProcedures.2">Change Procedures</h3>
<h4 local-id=3D"aa3726f7b8ba" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-If=
AddingANewSolution_Category__c">If Adding A New Solution_Category__c</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"dc2533d11077">
<li local-id=3D"f9281a9d9478">
<p local-id=3D"0f005de1f3b9">Add the new value to shared value set Solution=
_Category.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"a20caa66d36a">
<p local-id=3D"e523f73ad7ac">Add the new Solution_Group__c -&gt; Solution_C=
ategory__c mapping on Marketing_Product__c, Sales_Territory__c, and Account=
TeamMember.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"6ebf376361c1">
<p local-id=3D"b8c91768f366">Update any existing records that should use th=
e new category on Product2, Marketing_Product__c, Sales_Territory__c, Accou=
ntTeamMember, and Campaign.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"9e0602f62e2d">
<p local-id=3D"9e5cfe93f1ec">Add or update COLA_Uplift_Rules__mdt if the ne=
w category needs COLA behavior.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"83ff72f3de4a">
<p local-id=3D"d18ec39ca161">Add the new category to Fortra_Bulk_Price_Upda=
te_Flow if it must be selectable there.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"d25d75882f8b">
<p local-id=3D"88460fcb2340">Run the solution-category tests in the Automat=
ion Test Matrix.</p></li>
</ol>
<h4 local-id=3D"04b031940744" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-If=
RenamingSolution_Category__c">If Renaming Solution_Category__c</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"83607a769837">
<li local-id=3D"fb41001e4bac">
<p local-id=3D"66c05183e617">Rename the value in shared value set Solution_=
Category.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eb8c5aa4014c">
<p local-id=3D"ce81c4c39f4a">Replace the old value in every Solution_Group_=
_c -&gt; Solution_Category__c mapping table above.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"38b6f439eae4">
<p local-id=3D"665218253e7f">Update text data and metadata holding the old =
category on Product2.Solution_Category__c, COLA_Uplift_Rules__mdt.Solution_=
Category__c, and optionally QuoteLineItem.COLA_Solution_Category__c if hist=
orical reporting should align.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"2d084c20ba09">
<p local-id=3D"1482e2938049">Update the hardcoded category list in Fortra_B=
ulk_Price_Update_Flow.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"824d0889281c">
<p local-id=3D"6dfe975d5e2c">Update existing technical products if they sho=
uld reflect the rename.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"f9a477303d5d">
<p local-id=3D"91cb4934a1a6">Retest all solution-category-dependent automat=
ions and UI paths.</p></li>
</ol>
<h4 local-id=3D"f268d1b1f01e" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-If=
RemovingSolution_Category__c">If Removing Solution_Category__c</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"ce657bef22d2">
<li local-id=3D"4fa2012ba460">
<p local-id=3D"1aac21141117">Reassign or clear all records using that categ=
ory.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"59ad3fea6d9d">
<p local-id=3D"a5ee62a653f4">Remove the mapping from every Solution_Group__=
c -&gt; Solution_Category__c table above where it appears.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"efcb62dddff5">
<p local-id=3D"8325e9650c51">Remove or replace the value in shared value se=
t Solution_Category, in Fortra_Bulk_Price_Update_Flow, and in the related C=
OLA_Uplift_Rules__mdt record.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"62c87bf990ed">
<p local-id=3D"17efe55b7911">Decide whether historical QuoteLineItem.COLA_S=
olution_Category__c values remain unchanged.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"ef46265268b0">
<p local-id=3D"a7b4d5fcd0f2">Retest all solution-category-dependent automat=
ions and UI paths.</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"4011bb62e040" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-So=
lution__c">Solution__c</h2>
<p local-id=3D"8b09043eae10">Solution__c is simpler than the other hierarch=
y fields because it is text on Product2. The main operational consideration=
 is that technical products created by RCATechnicalProductService receive a=
 copied value at creation time and do not self-correct later.</p>
