<h3 local-id=3D"ba4167e1f29e" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-Ch=
angeProcedures.3">Change Procedures</h3>
<h4 local-id=3D"9a09730cc282" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-If=
AddingANewSolution__c">If Adding A New Solution__c</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"b99317f22874">
<li local-id=3D"2841774d21fd">
<p local-id=3D"f4eac6643aeb">Update any existing Product2 records that shou=
ld use the new solution.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"0a46dd4f27d3">
<p local-id=3D"cd0a70524952">Update any existing technical products that sh=
ould also use the new value.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"eb557a5033f8">
<p local-id=3D"4a0c2adf96f4">Validate downstream reporting where Solution__=
c is mirrored.</p></li>
</ol>
<h4 local-id=3D"fe067c9d6bc0" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-If=
RenamingSolution__c">If Renaming Solution__c</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"8c274f7a6abe">
<li local-id=3D"36b9e8739244">
<p local-id=3D"8f6b02e20ae2">Update Product2.Solution__c values directly.</=
p></li>
<li local-id=3D"90f93508704e">
<p local-id=3D"4f855a2cba3d">Update existing technical products if they sho=
uld stay aligned.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"bac0e9b08ba7">
<p local-id=3D"0a83bf956765">Validate downstream reporting where Solution__=
c is mirrored.</p></li>
</ol>
<h4 local-id=3D"d789e23f5db3" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-If=
RemovingSolution__c">If Removing Solution__c</h4>
<ol start=3D"1" local-id=3D"36e0d128d305">
<li local-id=3D"4a274d2a3adf">
<p local-id=3D"1f64ec6105cd">Reassign or clear Product2 records using that =
solution.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"b969afb849cb">
<p local-id=3D"95a17dcf47f3">Reassign or clear related technical products i=
f needed.</p></li>
<li local-id=3D"256646cbde8d">
<p local-id=3D"eca98b71781b">Validate downstream reporting where Solution__=
c is mirrored.</p></li>
</ol>
<h2 local-id=3D"433d31cdbd39" id=3D"SalesforceHierarchyManagementRunbook-Au=
tomationTestMatrix">Automation Test Matrix</h2>
<p local-id=3D"4e200a7711df">Use this matrix to validate the affected flows=
, triggers, Apex classes, and UI paths after a hierarchy change. Each row l=
ists the entry point and the record setup needed for confirmation.</p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
<table data-table-width=3D"760" data-layout=3D"default" data-local-id=3D"d2=
65ad4dc6af" class=3D"confluenceTable">
<tbody>
<tr data-local-id=3D"4f4a329ed115">
<th data-local-id=3D"888e57bd1a5f" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"8f1d98294522"><strong>Automation / UI</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"79b3eb0ba3a4" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"71380bd0929a"><strong>Entry Point</strong></p></th>
<th data-local-id=3D"1c96700b3e00" class=3D"confluenceTh">
<p local-id=3D"7f06af25be97"><strong>Exact Test Setup</strong></p></th>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"7411ff38db95">
<td data-local-id=3D"59571be1803f" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"ca09a4e29cb2">Sales_Territories_Before_Insert_Update</p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"b0b9ea0c41e4" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"a9179d1fb00c">Before-save flow on Sales_Territory__c</p></td=
>
<td data-local-id=3D"b6790d0a11cc" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"321e0ae0c98a">Create or edit a territory record using the ch=
anged hierarchy value and confirm Unique_Value__c recalculates correctly.</=
p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"91833f51cd11">
<td data-local-id=3D"c978dadca649" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"4e47a801f736">TerritoryFlowHelper</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"9ece30660472" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"f2965792a4fc">Invoked from Sales_Inquiry_Territory_Assignmen=
t</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"7285d2fee998" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"741d700fc12f">Create a Lead, related Marketing_Product__c, a=
nd matching Sales_Territory__c with the changed hierarchy value; confirm pr=
oduct assignment resolves as expected.</p></td>
</tr>
<tr data-local-id=3D"bdbd26c5cff3">
<td data-local-id=3D"b97df1f83d14" class=3D"confluenceTd">
<p local-id=3D"95d4866fc5e7">Sales_Inquiry_Territory_Assignment</p></td>
<td data-local-id=3D"a63745ab64ae" class=3D"confluenceTd">
